   "title": "Which treatment for which factor",
   "items": [
    "anovulation (PCOS) → weight loss, then LETROZOLE or clomiphene ± trigger",
    "endometriosis I–II → laparoscopic excision · III–IV → IVF",
    "low reserve → IVF at higher doses · age is not rescued by IVF",
    "BOTH partners need an infectious disease screen before IUI or IVF (law in Ontario)"
